    {
      "handle": "chandlerrome.bsky.social",
      "author": "Chandler Rome",
      "team": "アストロズ",
      "outlet": "The Athletic",
      "text": "Scott Boras said today that he called Astros owner Jim Crane recently to discuss Tatsuya Imai and how to build a better routine and structure for him - www.nytimes.com/athletic/777...",
