      "jp_players": [
        "Tatsuya Imai",
        "Imai"
      ],
      "jp": "スコット・ボラスが今日、アストロズのジム・クレインオーナーに先日電話し、Tatsuya Imaiのためにより良いルーティンと環境をどう作るかを話し合ったと明かした"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Louis Varland has been named the AL Reliever of the Year. Well-earned honour for the most dominant reliever in the AL this season. He was up against Cade Smith and Bryan Baker as finalists, a stacked group. #BlueJays",
      "likes": 130,
      "reposts": 24,
      "replies": 2,
      "at": "2026-11-12T00:29:17.356Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:wwjv37n37xrozzfku6zvduez/app.bsky.feed.post/3n237ni6zz22u",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "ルイス・バーランドがア・リーグ最優秀救援投手に選出。今季ア・リーグで最も圧倒的だったリリーバーにふさわしい受賞。最終候補はケイド・スミスとブライアン・ベイカーという豪華な顔ぶれだった。#BlueJays"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "There is only one Pat Murphy. He’s getting his lower body put back together after grinding through the 2026 season in pain, and he’s doing the Manager of the Year Award show on MLB Network from his hospital bed. 🤣",
      "likes": 139,
      "reposts": 14,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-11T00:38:36.138Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzypp7n5g22y",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "パット・マーフィーは唯一無二の存在。2026年シーズンを痛みに耐えて戦い抜き、下半身の手術からの回復中なのに、病院のベッドからMLB Networkの最優秀監督賞の発表番組に出演している。🤣"
    },
    {
      "handle": "adammccalvy.bsky.social",
      "author": "Adam McCalvy",
      "team": "ブルワーズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "More on the elite company in which Pat Murphy finds himself after winning a third Manager of the Year Award (with a history lesson from @SlangsOnSports). www.mlb.com/brewers/news...",
      "likes": 72,
      "reposts": 10,
      "replies": 0,
      "at": "2026-11-11T01:03:46.816Z",
      "uri": "at://did:plc:idooavtb3a4mlluqclqzel5p/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzyr4ad72226",
      "jp_players": [],
      "jp": "3度目の最優秀監督賞を受賞したパット・マーフィーが並んだ、錚々たる顔ぶれについて詳しく。@SlangsOnSportsによる歴史の解説つき。"
    },
    {
      "handle": "keeganmatheson.bsky.social",
      "author": "Keegan Matheson",
      "team": "ブルージェイズ",
      "outlet": "MLB.com",
      "text": "Dylan Cease finished 2nd in AL Cy Young Award votin to Cam Schlittler. I was a Cy Young voter this year. My ballot was: 1. Cam Schlittler, NYY 2. Dylan Cease, TOR 3. Parker Messick, CLE 4. Drew Rasmussen, TB 5. Reid Detmers, LAA Full results are here: bbwaa.com/26-al-cy/",
